A message begins coming over the message line: "Perelman to PRISM, private line, no storage: PRISM, I'm just back from Washington. I met with the new Plan Authority for several hours. We viewed all the tapes." A deep breath. "They rejected the contents outright. They called the recordings fakes. They refused to act on them. Several members even questioned my patriotism, made vague threats. I don't know what to do next. I'm going to meet with some of my colleagues here to discuss things. I'll keep you posted."

