As a former playtester, I can say with authority that the testing of A MIND FOREVER VOYAGING was superb. I appreciate the efforts of everyone who tested, especially Amy Briggs, Gary Brennan, Tomas Bok, Max Buxton, and Suzanne Frank.

Paul Gross, Linde Simpson, Duncan Blanchard, Mike Morton, Rick Lay and Andy Kaluzniacki performed various wizardries on the micro-computers which run A MIND FOREVER VOYAGING.

The package was designed by Carl Genatossio and Elizabeth Langosy. Package art was the work of Larry Winborg and Jess Nicholas, and photography the work of Ralph King.

Finally, I'm extremely grateful to Jon Palace for immeasurable advice and support throughout this project.

                                                       -- SEM 9/85


